            "description": "204 with no body when the queue is empty — a normal state, not an error. 200 carries `{task_id, infringement_id, user_ref, severity, triage, image_url, page_url, face_match_score, source_domain}`. `image_url` is EVIDENCE for URL-context review: never render, proxy, cache or hotlink it."
